<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάρροπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inclining downwards</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιεῖν τι</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κ. ῥέπειν</span>
			ibid.; <i>pendent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.1.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.567
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.330
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sloping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.14.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>tending to descend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Hum.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
